    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "content": "A Personal Space is a private Space that only you can access. You can use your Personal Space to organize your own tasks, notes, and information. It's a great place to start using Lists and workflows to manage your personal to-dos, shopping lists, reminders, and more. You can also use your Personal Space to experiment with different features and settings to customize your Lists and tasks to your liking.",
      "createdAt": "2024-05-25T06:31:18.202Z",
      "updatedAt": "2024-05-25T06:31:18.209Z",
