    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "content": "A workflow is a sequence of steps that you can use to manage and organize your tasks in a way that makes sense for your work. In a workflow, you can define different stages or statuses that a task can go through, such as \"To Do,\" \"In Progress,\" \"Pending Review,\" and \"Completed.\" You can also set up automation rules to move tasks between these statuses automatically based on certain triggers or conditions. Additionally, you can use ClickApps to add more functionality to your workflow, such as adding custom fields, creating task dependencies, or integrating with other tools you use. By defining a clear workflow, you can streamline your task management process, track the progress of your work, and ensure that nothing slips through the cracks.",
